cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the VEXMLM models, please cite the paper below."
title: "VEXMLM: Vocabulary-Extended XLM-R for Amharic and Tigrinya"
abstract: >-
  Official implementation of VEXMLM, a vocabulary-expansion framework that adapts
  XLM-R to the Ge'ez-script languages Amharic and Tigrinya through language-specific
  SentencePiece tokenization, mean-based embedding initialization, and two-stage
  training (continued MLM pretraining followed by task-specific fine-tuning).
  Evaluation spans intrinsic tokenizer quality and downstream question answering,
  named entity recognition, and sentiment analysis.
authors:
